{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "spanish", "appid": 924970, "month": "2022-01", "window": 2, "start_date": 1641686400, "end_date": 1642291199, "month_true_total": 72, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:11:12 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "108080784", "author": {"steamid": "76561198126267728", "personaname": "Asca", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ascapop/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 17797, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1383, "last_played": 1711925596, "avatar": "64455b3f80e6419b182bf68c483de214f5f56d75"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Casi pierdo a mi vato por esta wea, recomendado.", "timestamp_created": 1642276073, "timestamp_updated": 1642276073, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 25, "votes_funny": 10, "weighted_vote_score": "0.567284345626831055", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 2, "count": 3}]}, {"recommendationid": "108074857", "author": {"steamid": "76561198803293882", "personaname": "Lenka", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198803293882/", "num_games_owned": 8, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1457, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 688, "last_played": 1763430706, "avatar": "8e02f237948609468e6d8e7cd0c018aac3066caa"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "es muy buen juego y divertido\n", "timestamp_created": 1642270624, "timestamp_updated": 1642270624, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "107989844", "author": {"steamid": "76561198313910694", "personaname": "patatarules", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/patatarules/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1396, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1396, "last_played": 1642104394, "avatar": "8bb6a4d7223c09446bc0abb6570e5912d7f8b275"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Sinseramente me parece excesivo el precio para las pocas \"campañas\" que ofrece. \nMe lo he jugado 2 veces ya pasandolo enterito. \nLos bots son inutiles, quiza algo utiles cuando dropean municion, pero nada mas.\nEsta fancy pa jugarlo siendo 4 porque de otra manera pasarselo entero es imposible, estaba buguiado el final boss. \n\nLa parte positiva es que me gusta el caracter especifico que le han dado a cada personaje, graficamente me parece de 10, la historia en si me ha gustado; pero como digo me falta mucho contenido. \nEs muy aleatorio e injusto el daño que recibes a veces.\n\nPD: odio al pajas y al potas, y a los chochos(Jumpscare). Han hecho un enemigo que soy yo: La vieja (punto positivo)  \n\nLo recomendaria a mitad de precio o teniendo mas contenido a este precio.", "timestamp_created": 1642175324, "timestamp_updated": 1642175324, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 14, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.584406673908233643", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "107957427", "author": {"steamid": "76561198122723485", "personaname": "GRIM", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/grimskates/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 1659, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 220, "last_played": 1740389775, "avatar": "b8174a0d8fb1c1c2b1043aceb3af733e0b56f717"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Bought Evolve when it first came out because of all the hype. Years later it's now free with 19 players around the world lol. Back 4 Blood is following the same pattern as Evolve. So much hype piggy backing from the L4D craze when the game doesn't even come close to L4D.\n\nMost of the time I don't know what's happening lol I'm glad I got this game for free. Hopefully they fix this before it becomes another Evolve.", "timestamp_created": 1642126166, "timestamp_updated": 1642126166, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.553635537624359131", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "107955688", "author": {"steamid": "76561198309585174", "personaname": "YOLOXO", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/yoloxo123/", "num_games_owned": 31, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 11870, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6096, "last_played": 1756178354, "avatar": "4ab13885664ded6487988fd3d22d3ff865322770"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "estas bien aunque sigo esperando los mapas de la comunidad.. seran epicos..", "timestamp_created": 1642123602, "timestamp_updated": 1642123602, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519167602062225342", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}